            "uuid": "SG_RightCompartment_Overheating_@1a43752b",
            "description": [
                "The right compartment shall not be heated above 30 \u00b0C for longer than 5 s (ASIL A): an overheated cabin causes heat stress and driver drowsiness. Made up for the remotive_car example; the specification has no climate requirements.",
                "",
                "Signal path the guarantee rests on:",
                "",
                "```mermaid",
                "flowchart LR",
                "  occ([\"Occupant_RightTemperatureSetpoint\"]) --> ihu[\"IHU_Climate<br/>caps at 28 \u00b0C\"]",
                "  ihu -->|\"HVACService_RightTemperature<br/>SOME/IP\"| gwm[\"GWM_Climate<br/>forwards unchanged\"]",
                "  gwm -->|\"HVACControl.RightTemperature<br/>BodyCan0, 500 ms\"| hvac[\"HVAC_Climate<br/>saturates at 30 \u00b0C\"]",
                "  hvac --> cab([\"Climate_RightTemperature<br/>critical: > 30 \u00b0C for 5 s\"])",
                "```"
            ],
            "name": "SG_RightCompartment_Overheating",
            "version_schema": "4.6.2"
        }
    }
}
